[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801790467","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115395#issuecomment-3801790467","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115395","id":3801790467,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7imrgD","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T21:15:21Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T21:15:21Z","body":"1. The MRP fails on Linux even for 4.5. Your code is bugged, if the file contains `\\r\\n` it needs to be handled on Linux as well, e.g. `file.get_as_text().replace(\"\\r\\n\", \"\\n\").split(\"\\n\")`\n\n2. You are trying to load this path: `res:///icon.svg`. This path is clearly malformed and the fact that this loaded fine in 4.5 should be considered a bug. The correct path would be `res://icon.svg`. You should use `String::path_join` over `... + \"/\" + ...` to prevent such issues.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/co